# | Circutor CEM-C31 — 3-Phase Multifunctional Energy Meter (Modbus RTU RS-485)
# | 
# | Source: circutor-cem-c20-c30-instruction-manual.pdf (section 7.2, pp. 42-48)
# | Models with RS-485: CEM-C31-485-T1, CEM-C31-485-T1-MID, CEM-C31-485-DS, CEM-C31-485-DS-MID
# | Protocol: Modbus RTU, FC03/04 read, FC10 write, 8N1 default
# | Baud: 9600/19200/38400 bps (configurable at 0x03E9)
# | All MODBUS addresses are hexadecimal in the source; converted to decimal here.
# | All 32-bit values occupy 2 consecutive registers (big-endian word order).
# | Scaling: voltage ×10 (1 decimal), current ×100 (2 decimals), cos φ ×100 (2 decimals).
# | Tariff registers (0x0100-0x013A) available on CEM-C31-485-DS model only.
# | Digital input registers (0x0020, 0x0180, 0x0182) available on DS model only.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Circutor
@model=CEM-C31
@vendor_website=circutor.com
@description=3-phase energy meter, Modbus RTU RS-485 (CEM-C31-485 variants). FC03/04 read, FC10 write. Energy u32 Wh/varh at addr 0-10; instantaneous s32 at 1842-1884 (V×10, A×100, cos φ×100, W/var/VA). Config at 1000-1108. Tariff/DS-only regs at 256+ and 32/384.
